JQ87KQQKelMrdKGpxYYzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLxg0o8RxndMN1pAo8N8US-RmA00O_u_kIq3Wcn08hnyw&oe=6AB3F40D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Base.png", "id": "645995414509845", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_645995417843178_6506936718238058306_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yOXz65N82CAQ7kNvwHbNU5Z&_nc_oc=AdpYzxLrkVW7YwtpMHRQMScvlv-8bggCQEvr6K2qR_fEGvudyGNm1N0jvWLrSB9lJhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJCYlNROcc9sOcPf7crZNOVjAr4XTmqzMXwyL-M8OkcLQ&oe=6AB3D388"}, "display_name": "Shadowline", "keywords": ["Shadow", "Line", "Shadowline", "Shooter", "Tactical"], "long_description": "Shadowline is a tactical shooter inspired by Wildlands and Gray Zone Warfare. As an Army Ranger, you are deployed into a hostile Vietnam warzone where a local military force has seized control. Your mission: gather critical intelligence, secure vital resources, and navigate the dangers of a volatile battlefield where every decision counts. Engage in strategic combat, adapt to evolving threats, and immerse yourself in a high-stakes operation where survival and success depend on your tactics.\n\nShadowline is developed by a solo developer and is being released initially in early access. Thank you for your support and hope you enjoy Shadowline! ", "short_description": "Shadowline is a tactical shooter inspired by Wildlands and Gray Zone Warfare. As an Army Ranger, you are deployed into a hostile Vietnam warzone where a local military force has seized control. Your mission: gather critical intelligence, secure vital resources, and navigate the dangers of a volatile battlefield where every decision counts. Engage in strategic combat, adapt to evolving threats, and immerse yourself in a high-stakes operation where survival and success depend on your tactics."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pri